  "reflectionText": "Hagar fled into the wilderness. The angel of the Lord found her at the fountain on the way to Shur. She called the name of the Lord who spoke to her: you are a God who sees. Have you ever named God by what you saw of him in the wilderness, before anyone in your house had yet known you were gone from them?"
